474
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,080
It felt especially romantic.

475
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,040
It kind of made up for it.

476
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,040
Yeah, that's exactly how it felt.

477
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,600
And the weather

478
