528
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:33,460
I think,

529
00:14:33,460 --> 00:14:34,480
from my perspective,

530
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:36,490
you probably wanted

531
00:14:36,490 --> 00:14:38,070
