542
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,280
Honestly,

543
00:14:53,280 --> 00:14:54,760
I really respect Zhao Xilun.

544
00:14:54,760 --> 00:14:55,360
Because

545
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:55,960
like he said,

546
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:56,600
having an open

547
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,360
