Xing, I'll do it, Xing.

600
00:16:21,630 --> 00:16:23,030
Xing, I'll do it, Xing.

601
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:24,960
All I ever say is "Xing".

602
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,640
