I think it's when we're

1142
00:30:46,840 --> 00:30:49,120
both completely relaxed.

1143
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:49,720
You're...

1144
00:30:51,920 --> 00:30:52,800
That answer says nothing.

1145
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:53,400
How about I change it?

1146
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:54,200
Change it.

1147
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:54,840
I'll change it.

1148
00:30:54,840 --> 00:30:55,960
Okay.

1149
00:30:56,400 --> 00:30:57,240
How long before you start

1150
00:30:57,240 --> 00:30:59,240
missing me if we don't see each other?

1151
00:30:59,240 --> 00:31:00,600
Don't ask me the same thing.

1152
00:31:00,600 --> 00:31:01,840
No, I'm asking when you'd miss me.

1153
00:31:01,840 --> 00:31:02,240
Miss him.

1154
00:31:02,240 --> 00:31:03,640
You were asking how long you can go

1155
00:31:03,640 --> 00:31:04,840
without seeing each other.

1156
00:31:04,840 --> 00:31:06,040
Well...

1157
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,360
I miss you even when we're together.

1158
00:31:08,360 --> 00:31:09,360
So your question doesn't even work.

1159
00:31:09,360 --> 00:31:10,000
Ask something else.

1160
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,240
You got taken out in seconds.

1161
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:18,880
Do you prefer how I look in the morning

1162
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:19,840
or at night?

1163
00:31:20,400 --> 00:31:21,120
You mean you?

1164
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,560
You mean at the house?

1165
00:31:23,560 --> 00:31:24,360
In our everyday life.

1166
00:31:25,160 --> 00:31:27,040
You're pretty much the same
morning or night.

1167
00:31:29,560 --> 00:31:30,760
Ask another one.

1168
00:31:30,760 --> 00:31:32,760
No, let me explain.

1169
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:33,720
What I mean is

1170
00:31:33,720 --> 00:31:34,920
you...

1171
00:31:34,920 --> 00:31:35,640
I mean your hair

1172
00:31:35,640 --> 00:31:36,560
is already done

1173
00:31:36,560 --> 00:31:37,640
when you come find me.

1174
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:38,400
And at night

1175
00:31:38,400 --> 00:31:39,600
you've still got the same look.

1176
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:40,640
Still in the same clothes.

1177
00:31:40,640 --> 00:31:42,960
There really is a loophole
in your question,

1178
00:31:42,960 --> 00:31:43,800
I'm getting a little anxious.

1179
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:49,560
We've gone through all the questions.

1180
00:31:50,800 --> 00:31:51,720
So that's it for today's

1181
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:53,000
"Encore Theater".

1182
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:54,080
Well then,

1183
00:31:54,080 --> 00:31:54,880
let's say goodbye.

1184
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:55,800
Okay.

1185
